WEBVTT

00:04:35.406 --> 00:04:38.284
Some people think
I'm mad to live in the deep.

00:04:38.701 --> 00:04:41.412
I think that they are the ones
who are mad,

00:04:41.496 --> 00:04:44.123
not me the one who is mad, it's them.

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:46.375
It's a nice life, simple life.

00:04:46.542 --> 00:04:48.461
It's away from the hustle and bustle,

00:04:48.544 --> 00:04:50.171
all the stuff that you don't want.

00:04:50.254 --> 00:04:51.255
(CHOMPS)

00:04:52.798 --> 00:04:55.051
Mmm. Whale carcass.

00:04:55.801 --> 00:04:57.261
Anyway, you're gonna have fun.

00:04:57.553 --> 00:05:00.973
You'll get to hear me talk.
I can talk without stopping,

00:05:01.057 --> 00:05:04.227
sometimes for maybe 12 hours.

00:05:04.602 --> 00:05:07.021
And you get to listen, so you're lucky.

00:05:08.564 --> 00:05:10.066
Well done.

